return {
    ["\n\n\n\n\n\n\n潜意识和梦境，都会受到音乐影响。\n其中的凶猛生物，也<InvHighlight>可能在音乐的影响下变得温和</>。"] = "\n \n \n \n \n \n \n Both the subconscious and dreams are influenced by music. \n The fierce creatures within <InvHighlight> may also become gentle under the influence of music. </>",
