    ["<Assistant_Title1>【命运时刻】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>命运时刻</>是<Assistant_Red>12对12多人战场</>。非凡者会分为两个阵营，每场对局持续<Assistant_Red>4分钟</>。对局结束时，分数较高的一方获胜；若积分相同，则依次比较击杀数、伤害量，均相同则随机一方获胜。\n<Assistant_Title2>积分获取：</>可通过拾取<Assistant_Property1>增益光点</>、击杀、助攻、进入<Assistant_Property1>纷争漩涡</>争夺来获得积分。增益光点会提供积分及属性加成；纷争漩涡倒计时结束时，仍留在漩涡内的非凡者会平分积分。\n<Assistant_Title2>汇集锚点：</>对局内会出现汇集锚点并持续<Assistant_Red>15秒</>。根据锚点需求人数进入锚点并达到要求后，持续<Assistant_Red>3秒</>即可将本阵营非凡者集结至此，参与集结的非凡者会获得限时属性加成。\n<Assistant_Title2>匹配规则：</>玩法入口显示开放时间为<Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>。命运时刻最多允许<Assistant_Red>3人组队匹配</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往命运时刻]|1250095}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Moment of Fate】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Moment of Fate</> is a <Assistant_Red>12v12 multiplayer battlefield</>. Beyonders are divided into two factions, and each match lasts <Assistant_Red>4 minutes</>. When the match ends, the side with the higher score wins; if the points are equal, compare kills, then damage dealt; if all are the same, a random side wins.\n<Assistant_Title2>Point Acquisition:</>You can obtain points by picking up <Assistant_Property1>Buff Orbs</>, killing, assisting, and entering the <Assistant_Property1>Vortex of Strife</> to compete. Buff Orbs provide points and attribute bonuses; when the countdown for the Vortex of Strife ends, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gathering Anchor:</>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Assistant_Red>15 seconds</>. After entering the anchor and reaching the required number of people, stay for <Assistant_Red>3 seconds</> to assemble your faction's Beyonders here; Beyonders participating in the assembly will receive a time-limited attribute bonus.\n<Assistant_Title2>Matchmaking Rules:</>The gameplay entry shows the opening time as <Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>. Moment of Fate allows a maximum of <Assistant_Red>3-player team matchmaking</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Moment of Fate]|1250095}",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">守护坚壁</>获得新的分支<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061063\" color=\"#f4a067\">守护壁垒</>：展开领域，为周围30米范围内生命值最低的两个友方加上高额护盾和15%的减伤，护盾值根据消耗的<HighLight>黄昏印记</>数增加。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061060\" color=\"#f4a067\">Guardian Wall</> gains a new branch <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061063\" color=\"#f4a067\">Guardian Rampart</>: Deploy a field that grants a high-value shield and 15% damage reduction to the two allies with the lowest health within 30 meters. The shield value increases based on the number of <HighLight>Dusk Marks</> consumed.",
    ["<P_Heart>（点头）</>有一定难度，所以我白天工作，晚上自学文法和会计。"] = "<P_Heart>(Nods)</> It had a certain level of difficulty, so I worked during the day and self-studied grammar and accounting at night.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>我能同时把他们俩都干趴下，可惜……"] = "<P_Heart> (Whispering) </> I could take them both down at the same time, but unfortunately...",
    ["<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>36%</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>0.24秒</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>36%</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>0.24 seconds</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds.",
