    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演战士】\n在金秋湖畔的木屋边，你看见两个粗暴的混混正在找一个女孩的麻烦……"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Warrior】 \n Beside the wooden house by Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble...",
