    ["你在廷根街头遇到又被猎龙帮欺负的泰瑞，决心为他伸张正义。教训了混混后，你意外得知他们正筹备一场荒唐的“猎龙行动”——这是瑞尔·比伯创建猎龙帮时的宏大理想，被他的好兄弟凯文坚决继承。当然，在真正的巨龙面前，渺小的猎龙帮还是太渺小了。不过那又如何，他们仍有理想，他们仍在坚持，他们依旧能重新开始——在恶龙酒吧通过吹嘘不存在的“勇者斗恶龙”招揽帮众……"] = "You meet Terry on the streets of Tingen, who is being bullied by the Dragon Hunter Gang again, and decide to seek justice for him. After teaching the thugs a lesson, you accidentally learn that they are preparing for an absurd 'Dragon Hunting Operation'—this was the grand ideal of Ray Bieber when he founded the Dragon Hunter Gang, which his good brother Kevin is determined to inherit. Of course, in front of a real giant dragon, the tiny Dragon Hunter Gang is still too tiny. But so what? They still have ideals, they are still persisting, and they can still start over—by bragging about non-existent 'Hero Slaying Dragons' at the Evil Dragon Bar to recruit gang members...",
